OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage Manx transport set for
OL,4,Aseason finale
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man's heritage railways
OL,7,Fwill close for the season this weekend,
OL,8,Fwith special services and events
OL,9,Fplanned to mark the occasion.
OL,11,FTwo of the Manx Electric Railway's
OL,12,Foldest trams, dating from 1893 and
OL,13,F1894, will be in service, while a
OL,14,Fhistoric steam locomotive will mark 140
OL,15,Fyears of the Foxdale branch line.
OL,17,FSmaller railways and heritage groups
OL,18,Facross the island will also put on
OL,19,FHop-tu-Naa ghost trains, open days and
OL,20,Fvintage bus trips.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
